  "title": "Syracuse Parcel Map (Q3 2017)",
  "description": "Parcel dataset created by the Department of Neighborhood and Business Development. This dataset includes a large amount of information about each parcel (or area of land for properties) in the city. This dataset is updated quarterly. A data dictionary is located here . Data Dictionary: Label Definition TAX_ID, TAX_ID_1 City Tax ID number (26 digit number used for parcel mapping) Shape_Leng Length of polygon Shape_Area Area of Polygon PRINTKEY Property Tax Number Sec_Block Section & Block SURA Yes/No NHood Planning Neighborhoods Quad Codes/DPW Quads TNT_NAME Tomorrow's Neighborhoods Today area that the parcel is located in SpecialNh Special Neighborhood Assessment Assessment District CensusTrac Census Tract CC_Dist Common Council District COUNTY_LEG County Legislative SEIZB Y = seizable for tax delinquency Owner Property Owner LandUse Land use catergories condensed - you can sort into more detailed categories Units Only for multi-unit residential buildings TotTaxOwed Total Taxes Owed by the owner StNum Street Number StName Street Name FullAdd Full Address Condition Condition score of the property (1= Worst, 5=Best) VacantBuil Y = Determined vacant by the Division of Code Enforcement STAR Y = property is taking advantage of the owner occupant exeption Owner2 Second Owner line Add1, Add2, Add3, Add4 Owner Address ZIP, ZIP2 Owner Zip WaterServi I = inactive water YearBuilt Year Built SALES Property Sales PNUMBR Property Number WARD Ward SBL Section, block, lot number, same as the propert number Bankruptcy Bankruptcy or Foreclosure 'flagged' TaxTrust Active Tax Trust SENIOR_EXE Senior Tax Exemption VET_EXE Veteran Tax Exemption Dataset Contact Information: Organization: City of Syracuse Position: Data Program Manager Email: opendata@syr.gov City: Syracuse, NY",
